    "pair_set": "All unordered pairs of start, each settlement, capital gateway and featured landmark; crossing-near/far and later rural sites excluded.",
    "stretch": "Country centerline shortest distance divided by physical-tile Manhattan distance. This lower bound ignores terrain, so excess is descriptive, not a proof of avoidable detour."
